  "subject": "Set your first ${PRODUCT_NAME} password",
  "body": "<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:__ISC_BRAND_NAVIGATION_COLOR__;\">Set Your First Password</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">Dear ${userDisplayName},</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">Welcome to ${PRODUCT_NAME}. To get started, please set your ${PRODUCT_NAME} password.</p>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:12px 16px;border-left:4px solid __ISC_BRAND_ACTION_COLOR__;background-color:#f7f7f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">Your username: <strong>${userName}</strong></div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">Select <a href=\"${verificationURL}\" style=\"color:__ISC_BRAND_ACTION_COLOR__;text-decoration:underline;\">this link</a> to set your password.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">If the link does not work, copy and paste the following URL into your browser: ${verificationURL}</p>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:12px 16px;border-left:4px solid __ISC_BRAND_NAVIGATION_COLOR__;background-color:#f7f7f7;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">This link expires after ${expirationTime} hours.</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">Thank you,<br/>The ${PRODUCT_NAME} Team</p>",
  "origin": "cursor-redesign",
